(text "J1: protected 1S / 4.2 V pack, polarity must match.\nSW87 disconnects battery from module. OFF also disconnects charging.\nUSB may still power the keyboard with SW87 OFF.\nOnly the module charger is connected; no separate BQ24072/NTC here.\nValidate charge current, cell temperature protection and pack compatibility.\nVCC is the module switched 3.3 V rail. Six 1k LED resistors: conservative\ninitial brightness/current; Q1 provides common active-high PWM." (at 20.32 220.98 0)
